  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of a senior secured loan of up to EUR 100 million to be committed in  tranches in favour of CEE BIG BV (&quot;CEE BIG&quot; or the &quot;Company&quot;), a limited  liability company incorporated in the Netherlands, to finance the development,  upgrade and/or acquisitions of modern retail parks and shopping centres in  Serbia and the Western Balkans region (the &quot;Project&quot;).  The operation will enable the Company to expand its portfolio of modern retail  parks and shopping centres in the Western Balkans region.</narrative>
